::Q001::[markdown]παιδεύσομεν:{
	~%-100%pluperfect active indicative 1st pl. of the verb “I order”#Incorrect. The pluperfect active indicative 1st pl. of the verb “I order” is **ἐκεκελεύκαμεν** (Ch. 3).
	~%100%future active indicative 1st pl. of the verb “I educate”#Correct: **παιδεύσομεν** is future active indicative 1st pl. of the verb “I educate” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%present active indicative 2nd sing. of the verb “I send”#Incorrect. The present active indicative 2nd sing. of the verb “I send” is **πέμπεις** (Ch. 3).
	~%-100%aorist (1) active subjunctive 3rd pl. of the verb “I loosen”#Incorrect. The aorist (1) active subjunctive 3rd pl. of the verb “I loosen” is **λύσωσιν** (Ch. 3).
	~%-100%present active indicative 2nd pl. of the verb “I order”#Incorrect. The present active indicative 2nd pl. of the verb “I order” is **κελεύετε** (Ch. 2).
}


