	~%-100%acc. pl. of the noun “word”#Incorrect. The acc. pl. of the noun “word” is **λόγους** (Ch. 1).
	~%100%acc. pl. of the noun “human being”#Correct: **ἀνθρώπους** is acc. pl. of the noun “human being” (Chapter 1).
