}


::Q004::[markdown]fem. acc. sing. of the definite article “the”:{
	~%-100%τῶν#Incorrect. **τῶν** is the fem. gen. pl. of the definite article “the” (Ch. 1).
	~%-100%ταῖς#Incorrect. **ταῖς** is the fem. dat. pl. of the definite article “the” (Ch. 1).
	~%100%τήν#Correct: **τήν** is the correct form for fem. acc. sing. of the definite article “the” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%τό#Incorrect. **τό** is the neut. nom. sing. of the definite article “the” (Ch. 1).
	~%-100%τά#Incorrect. **τά** is the neut. nom. pl. of the definite article “the” (Ch. 1).
}


